{"id":"e4cdc6123abf4dd8","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-morse-theory.md","title":"Morse Theory","display":"df-morse-theory — Morse Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-morse-theory","aliases":["58-df-morse-theory"],"display":"df-morse-theory — Morse Theory","depends_on":["[[58-df-morse-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-morse-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-morse-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-morse-theory — Morse Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62ba03663f91241e\" href=\"?note=62ba03663f91241e\" title=\"58-df-morse-function\">58-df-morse-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\">\\(\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S\\subseteq V^{7}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,f,p,n,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,f,p,n,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> (smooth manifold structure, function, point, dimension and candidate index)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\)</span> (five-place Morse-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"62ba03663f91241e\" href=\"?note=62ba03663f91241e\" title=\"58-df-morse-function\">58-df-morse-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)\">\\(D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)\\)</span> (atlas-relative differential and Hessian)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S\\)</span> (Morse-index predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morse\\text{-}index}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S(\\lambda,p,f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\land D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)=0\\land\n\\lambda=\\max\\left\\{\\dim W:W\\leq T_pM\\land\n\\forall v\\in W\\setminus\\{0_{T_pM}\\}\\;\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)(v,v)&lt;0\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morse\\text{-}index}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S(\\lambda,p,f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\land D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)=0\\land\n\\lambda=\\max\\left\\{\\dim W:W\\leq T_pM\\land\n\\forall v\\in W\\setminus\\{0_{T_pM}\\}\\;\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)(v,v)&lt;0\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Morse index is computed from the same explicit topology and smooth atlas used by the upstream Morse-function predicate; no free differential or Hessian remains.</li>\n<li>Handle decompositions arise from gradient flows.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-morse-function","status":"resolved","id":"62ba03663f91241e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-morse-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-morse-function","status":"resolved","id":"62ba03663f91241e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)$ (five-place Morse-function predicate, see [[58-df-morse-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S\\subseteq V^{7}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S\\subseteq V^{5}","display":false},{"tex":"M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,f,p,n,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morse\\text{-}index}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MorseIndex}_S(\\lambda,p,f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MorseFunction}_S(f,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land p\\in M\\land D_{\\mathcal A}f(p)=0\\land\n\\lambda=\\max\\left\\{\\dim W:W\\leq T_pM\\land\n\\forall v\\in W\\setminus\\{0_{T_pM}\\}\\;\\operatorname{Hess}_{\\mathcal A}(f,p)(v,v)<0\\right\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1392,"backlinks":[{"id":"514ed893e8fcac45","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-862","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-morse-theory.md|58-df-morse-theory]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["62ba03663f91241e"]}